invariant: INV-14
file: srv_resume.c
catches: srv_flight_test
reason: a server that selects a ticket keeps the signature scheme it
  chose from the hello's signature_algorithms, so ch_tls.sigalg names a
  scheme for a resumed session that sent no CertificateVerify. Every
  client that offers schemes beside its ticket, OpenSSL's s_client among
  them, sees it. The selected-ticket row expects sigalg 0 and objects.

--- old
    sel->sigalg = 0;
    h->ticket_auth_seconds = auth_seconds;
--- new
    h->ticket_auth_seconds = auth_seconds;
